Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:06.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關鍵果然是這第一中繼站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.30,0:00:08.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不先把它打下來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就無法知道何時會從何方攻來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:12.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:14.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離目標還有180
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:38.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先派2艘快船過去 以奪取中繼站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:41.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布旗下的主力則去破壞Requiem本體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:46.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明ZAFT月球艦隊就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不好辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:50.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只能這麼做了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:53.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不想讓他們失敗的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:55.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,決定勝負的關鍵在於速度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:01:00.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在被敵人的增援包圍之前 奪下中繼站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:02.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離目標還有150
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:05.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT軍防衛線 現在顯示光學圖像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:10.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 Archangel以及Eternal正在接近Station One
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:13.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而Daedalus也發現奧布艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:16.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉斯卡羅拉西亞級 以及地球軍艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:17.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.73,0:01:22.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva Gondwana以及月球艦隊的半數 去Station One
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,餘下的去Daedalus的羅蘭那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:26.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.69,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1139.2,665.2)}{\fad(500,0)}{\blur4}光速偏向站 二號站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.95,0:01:28.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Station Two怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:32.73,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1124.8,665.2)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}光速偏向站 一號站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有艦影接近 數量為2艘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Red22 Charlie 距離為120
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:37.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,問題不在於數量和裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傳令進入紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:41.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防衛部隊立即出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,問題在於…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:48.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 出擊 可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:49.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:51.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:53.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Meteor啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員進入第一戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去Eternal前面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried Valiant啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.35,0:02:06.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈發射管全部裝填Korinthos彈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和  Freedom出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:15.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  Justice出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:24.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為我打開通訊回路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:25.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Meteor脫離
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:31.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Eternal的拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向守護中繼站的ZAFT軍各將士宣告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:45.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在將摧毀那無用的大規模殺傷性武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:47.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:49.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 是哪個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:50.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:56.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是什麼非保護不可或是戰鬥中不可或缺的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:03:02.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果還是為了和平 還對身著的軍裝感到驕傲的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓開路來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:11.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 雷 還有真  你們總算來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.88,Title SEED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\blur5}雷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:11.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:14.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是Logos的殘黨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:19.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不聽議長的勸阻 固執地堅守著自身的理念
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:21.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是他們的殘存勢力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:25.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開火 把他們全打下來 為了ZAFT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:26.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:54.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦隊司令部來電
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:59.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,守衛部隊正在Station One 同Archangel以及Eternal處於交戰狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:03.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球艦隊以及Minerva立即前去支援
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:06.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Ar...Archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過沒聯絡也屬正常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:15.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到底還是ZAFT軍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:16.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:19.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之給我出動 快讓船出發
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:20.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.81,0:06:27.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來好像沒精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:32.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:36.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會是發生了這麼多事 而疑惑了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:43.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實 從Armory 1搶奪事件起到Junius 7的墜落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.03,0:06:47.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及開戰後弄成現在這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管誰都會疑惑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:57.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這儘是棘手之事 儘是戰火的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:06:59.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多也該結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:00.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:06.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 應該是說 「請讓它結束了吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:08.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以你們的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:09.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:16.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷 有4枚導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避  Helldart發射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停止戰鬥 請讓開路來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:32.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西 不管是朝向何方 都不該發射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:34.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快退下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:44.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目前 Requiem的Station One
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:47.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正受到Archangel以及Eternal的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:54.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我以此攻擊了有反抗跡象的聯合軍Arzachel基地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這大概成了他們的藉口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:00.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 真是讓人頭痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:04.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明明不想繼續這樣戰鬥下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:08.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣看來 真不知何時才能結束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 但這也是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:14.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他們不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:20.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在萬一我們在他們面前有所軟弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:24.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界只會重返混沌與黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊在悲嘆一邊卻在爭鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:30.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭的歷史無法終結
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:31.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這沒什麼區別
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:33.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:36.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當人們在不斷探求和平與幸福之時的背後
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:40.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界又必將孕育新的Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:43.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的人就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:51.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不想讓世界變成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才做到這份上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:54.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Plan必須得付諸實施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:01.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:24.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:28.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼看 真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:31.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也這麼認為嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:45.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:51.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實際上我已經沒什麼未來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:54.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,天生染色體端粒過短
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:10:00.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是克隆人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:07.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了創造出基拉 大和這樣一個完美之人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被製造了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:18.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕只是因為「能做到」這一理由
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但結果 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:27.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有父母
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:31.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道造我之人的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比常人更早衰老
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經堅持不了多長時間的這身體
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:41.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根本無法想像是科學進步的驚人結果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個我詛咒這命運
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:50.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想破壞一切 最後戰死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但到底是誰的錯 是誰犯了錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:04.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們任何人 都是這世界創造的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:15.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 要結束這一切後回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不讓我們這樣的孩子再次出生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:25.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以這未來 由你來保護
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:32.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我和雷的想法一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:47.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Orange 12處 又出現4架MS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:50.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵10 Kolintos發射
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:56.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐 羅阿諾克  Akatsuki出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢攻擊拉克絲小姐的船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:13.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是吃了豹子膽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種是什麼MS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:22.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先別管這個 該怎麼辦啊 隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:23.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要出去被秒殺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 如果就這點膽量 一開始就別出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:35.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:38.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,波魯蒂爾號在後方支援
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:39.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到沒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:41.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別衝到前面 會沒命的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:42.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:50.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:51.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但其實都是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是因為不知道將來會發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:03.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在也只能繼續自己堅信的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:05.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是同感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以現在只有戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:11.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了將它結束
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:13.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:17.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦現在進入戰鬥狀態 Impulse出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:20.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全部炮管打開 瞄準Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:22.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:26.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以ZAFT的名義 今天一定要擊沉那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:36.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:38.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵10 下舵15
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried瞄準 Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:09.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過怎麼辦啊 伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:10.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你該不會是想…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在想揍的只有那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:18.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,居然又在那種地方鬼混
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:31.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  核心戰機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:57.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開火
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.85,0:15:08.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Station One不久就會淪陷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:10.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:12.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是划得來的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:16.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之後 他們應該會直接來這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:19.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎麼說數量也太少
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:20.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impluse 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:32.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就行了吧 這樣就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:34.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:39.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳? 在Eternal嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:42.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要戰鬥 為什麼要戰鬥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:45.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰才是真正的拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼妳就看不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:52.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然Minerva和守衛部隊會消耗他們不少戰力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:56.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但要知道他們很強
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不進攻一切就都結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:01.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:05.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬茲 艾爾伯特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.01,0:16:07.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用那招 聽到沒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:08.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:09.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉他們還沒解決嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:28.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回轉30度 Tannhuser啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:36.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva 陽電子炮處於發射狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:38.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:42.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果本艦移動 那Eternal就…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:44.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開火
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你擊沉Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:06.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:19.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會再去其它地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:33.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結束後一起回去吧 瑪琉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:35.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:45.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙 又在這裡幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼幹嘛 難道不是要擊落那東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,堤亞哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我要說的不是這事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種事 已經無所謂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是先做要緊的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,堤亞哥 你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:02.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要擊落那東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:05.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:09.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 瑪尤現在不能接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:10.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,稍稍休息過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們差不多該出擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:50.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,情況…Minerva呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:53.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然Minerva也在奮戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但Station One還是被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:19:00.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正在追擊朝這裡攻來的Archangel他們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:07.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva 發射氘光束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:08.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就這樣過去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:12.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心 露娜瑪莉雅沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:16.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要對她有信心 她很強的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:23.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們將同去Daedalus的主力艦隊匯合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:28.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並向世人展示奧布的實力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話 世界又會分裂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:41.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要親手拯救那個國家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:44.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標距離8000
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Lohengrin瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:57.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:05.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Messiah現在進入戰鬥狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:06.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:07.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全部攻擊準備啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:11.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Neo-Genesis 準備
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:25.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:31.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:35.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Orange186 出現前進中的巨大物體
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:36.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要塞?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.41,0:20:40.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標 距射程還有20
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.60,0:20:42.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反中子干擾器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:44.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各原子核 到達裂變位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉到高能量體
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:49.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦隊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:50.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.07,0:20:52.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標進入射程內
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:53.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:01.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最大输出 迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快點重新補充能量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:24.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:30.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:39.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 沒想到他竟然還有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:40.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva從後方接近
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離22
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 這次就讓妳徹底消失
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:21:59.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.43,0:21:59.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:02.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 上吧  基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:18.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:23.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你的存在 不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:26.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那也許是夢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:29.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為失去的時間已經回不來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:35.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天世界也孕育了新的生命 所以…
